      "cooked": "<p>This combo just made me laugh during my last game.</p><p>mars brings out the countdown bomb card, can't remember it's name. So then haka plays out ground pound. Every turn then haka skipped for the countdown clock which since it never destroyed the ground pound villains could do no damage. Just imagined haka screwing around with a clock saying I got this while the villains said \"oh no\" in that one guys voice from family guy&nbsp;</p>",
